      "line": "5 + 3 = 8 vs DC 13 FAIL"
    },
    {
      "op": "narrate",
      "text": "It is like reading a page while someone spins the book. Branches. Sky. A pale blur that turns out to be her own face."
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "I see trees. Sky. Myself, upside down. I do not know which way is...",
      "speaker": "ilsevel",
      "emote": "sweat"
    },
    {
      "op": "despawn",
      "actor": "pell"
    },
    {
      "op": "narrate",
      "text": "The first grey shape is already out of the birches, low and fast."
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "Wolves! Three of them. Get behind me!",
      "speaker": "brannoc",
      "emote": "alert"
