    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "Starved, and far from wherever they belong. And look at the fur. It has gone grey at the tips. Not old. Drained.",
      "speaker": "ilsevel"
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "Like the grass at Lantern Thirty-Seven. Something drove them out of the deep woods.",
      "speaker": "ilsevel"
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "Then we're walking toward it.",
      "speaker": "brannoc"
